(895,1887,'Inflammation of the ear, which may be marked by pain, fever, abnormalities of hearing, hearing loss, tinnitus, and vertigo. Inflammation of the external ear is OTITIS EXTERNA; of the middle ear, OTITIS MEDIA; of the inner ear, LABYRINTHITIS. (From Dorland, 27th ed)','en',2,'2026-09-16 21:07:19',NULL,NULL,'9469FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
