(1252,2662,'State in which an individual perceives or experiences a sensation of unreality concerning the self or the environment; it is seen in disorders such as schizophrenia, affection disorders, organic mental disorders, and personality disorders. (APA, Thesaurus of Psychological Index Terms, 8th ed.)','en',2,'2026-09-16 21:08:07',NULL,NULL,'5528FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
