(1255,2668,'Difficulty in swallowing.','en',2,'2026-09-16 21:08:07',NULL,NULL,'5495FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1256,2670,'Chronically depressed mood that occurs for most of the day more days than not for at least 2 years. The required minimum duration in children to make this diagnosis is 1 year. During periods of depressed mood, at least 2 of the following additional symptoms are present: poor appetite or overeating, insomnia or hypersomnia, low energy or fatigue, low self esteem, poor concentration or difficulty making decisions, and feelings of hopelessness. (DSM-IV)','en',2,'2026-09-16 21:08:07',NULL,NULL,'5488FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
