(1456,3052,'Disorders in which the symptoms are distressing to the individual and recognized by him or her as being unacceptable. Social relationships may be greatly affected but usually remain within acceptable limits. The disturbance is relatively enduring or recurrent without treatment.','en',2,'2026-09-16 21:08:25',NULL,NULL,'3328FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
